        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="cav">People also read</div>
      <h2>Keep going</h2>
      <div class="sec">
        <ul class="pillars">
          <li><span class="dot">&rarr;</span><div><b><a href="/playbooks/p-value-and-confidence-interval/">P-Values and Confidence Intervals, Read Correctly</a></b> The companion piece on reading significance without the usual traps.</div></li>
          <li><span class="dot">&rarr;</span><div><b><a href="/playbooks/z-score-calculator/">How to Calculate and Read a Z-Score</a></b> Standard scores and where critical z-values come from.</div></li>
          <li><span class="dot">&rarr;</span><div><b><a href="/playbooks/normal-distribution-calculator/">How to Read Normal Distribution Probabilities</a></b> The bell curve the t-distribution approaches.</div></li>
